      "created_at": "2026-01-21T07:59:03.343Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This seems to be a bug. The issue is reported on the GitHub</p><aside class=\"onebox githubissue\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/issues/51955\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/issues/51955\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">github.com/frappe/erpnext</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"github-row\">\n  <div class=\"github-icon-container\" title=\"Issue\" data-github-private-repo=\"false\">\n\t  <svg width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"github-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7 2.3c3.14 0 5.7 2.56 5.7 5.7s-2.56 5.7-5.7 5.7A5.71 5.71 0 0 1 1.3 8c0-3.14 2.56-5.7 5.7-5.7zM7 1C3.14 1 0 4.14 0 8s3.14 7 7 7 7-3.14 7-7-3.14-7-7-7zm1 3H6v5h2V4zm0 6H6v2h2v-2z\"></path></svg>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"github-info-container\">\n    <h4>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/issues/51955\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">POS Opening Entry asking for Cashier but after creating user the Name does not display</a>\n    </h4>\n\n    <div class=\"github-info\">\n      <div class=\"date\">\n        opened <span class=\"discourse-local-date\" data-format=\"ll\" data-date=\"2026-01-21\" data-time=\"07:56:54\" data-timezone=\"UTC\">07:56AM - 21 Jan 26 UTC</span>\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"user\">\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/sanjay141986\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n          <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108865344?v=4\" class=\"onebox-avatar-inline\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n          sanjay141986\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"labels\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;background-color: #B8B8B8;padding: 2px;border-radius: 4px;color: #fff;margin-left: 3px;\">\n          bug\n        </span>\n        <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;background-color: #B8B8B8;padding: 2px;border-radius: 4px;color: #fff;margin-left: 3px;\">\n          frappe-support\n        </span>\n        <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;background-color: #B8B8B8;padding: 2px;border-radius: 4px;color: #fff;margin-left: 3px;\">\n          POS\n        </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  <div class=\"github-row\">\n    <p class=\"github-body-container\">### Information about bug\n\n**Issue:**\nThe user is unable to select the Cashier i<span class=\"show-more-container\"><a href=\"\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"show-more\">…</a></span><span class=\"excerpt hidden\">n the POS opening entry. The user name is not appearing in the Dropdown list.\n\n&lt;img width=\"1208\" height=\"559\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cfb8ca8e-a7ea-41e1-b156-0f89df243eef\" /&gt;\n\n**Expected Solution:**\nA chasier should be linked with the user profile or if need to create separate then it has clear information about the role to be set for cashier.\n\n### Module\n\nselling\n\n### Version\n\nFrappe Version: v16.2.0 (HEAD)\nERPNext: v16.1.0 (HEAD)\n\n### Installation method\n\nNone\n\n### Relevant log output / Stack trace / Full Error Message.\n\n```shell\n\n```</span></p>\n  </div>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
