    {
      "id": 492150,
      "username": "sanjaytambe",
      "name": "sanjay",
      "created_at": "2026-01-22T06:54:54.257Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The POS Opening Entry will be disabled for manual access, as it must be created from the actual POS screen. When a user logs in to the POS for the day, they are required to enter the opening details directly in the POS interface. This action will automatically create and record the corresponding POS Opening Entry in the system <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/pull/51984\" class=\"inline-onebox\">fix(pos_opening_entry): disable pos opening entry creation using form view by diptanilsaha · Pull Request #51984 · frappe/erpnext · GitHub</a></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/c/8ca9625959ecf27295839a78cda826f6d7b903fb.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/8ca9625959ecf27295839a78cda826f6d7b903fb\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/c/8ca9625959ecf27295839a78cda826f6d7b903fb_2_640x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"k4lKub0bidN7RFsyyDiD2pSBSVZ\" width=\"640\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/c/8ca9625959ecf27295839a78cda826f6d7b903fb_2_640x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/c/8ca9625959ecf27295839a78cda826f6d7b903fb_2_960x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/c/8ca9625959ecf27295839a78cda826f6d7b903fb.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1160×906 38.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
